+    $$ t_2 = t^2, \quad t_3 = t^3 $$
+    
+    Compute basis functions (Hermite coefficients):
+    $$ h_{00} = 2t^3 - 3t^2 + 1 $$
+    $$ h_{10} = t^3 - 2t^2 + t $$
+    $$ h_{01} = -2t^3 + 3t^2 $$
+    $$ h_{11} = t^3 - t^2 $$
